+# Tabler Icons (subset)
+
+Tabler Icons 3.31.0, MIT license: `LICENSE`.
+Upstream: https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons
+
+Vendored outline SVGs used as hospital facility marks (entrance, restroom, elevator, stairs, etc.).
+Only this small subset is copied; paths are inlined by `preview/facility-icons.js` so the preview stays offline.
